# Host-side bytecode never enters a build context: a judge run on the host imports
# modules from sources/ and writes __pycache__ there; the next build then misses the
# cache and a rebuilt colcon layer gets another image ID (S2-B control, 30 September
# 2026, results/evidence/runs/LIFECYCLE_REGRESSIONS.md). Last, so they win over the
# includes above.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
